{"entries":[{"id":"junyanglin-2608.02352","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸","title":"Qwen-CUA: Native Computer Use for (almost) Everything","titleZh":"Qwen-CUA：原生计算机使用，几乎适用于一切","published":"2026-08-03T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1785715200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2608.02352/","image":"","summary":"Qwen-CUA, a native computer-use agent with a 397B-A17B MoE backbone, achieves state-of-the-art results on eight benchmarks by learning from screenshots and keyboard/mouse actions, outperforming Qwen3.7 and rivaling proprietary systems.","summaryZh":"Qwen-CUA 通过仅观察截图和模拟键盘鼠标操作，在八个基准测试中超越 Qwen3.7 并媲美专有系统，展示了原生计算机使用作为通用智能体基础的潜力。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2604.15804","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸 · Alibaba Qwen","title":"Qwen3.5-Omni Technical Report","titleZh":"Qwen3.5-Omni 技术报告","published":"2026-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1776384000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2604.15804/","image":"https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2604.15804/assets/figures/image.png","summary":"Qwen3.5-Omni achieves SOTA on 215 audio/audio-visual tasks, introduces ARIA for stable speech synthesis, and supports 10+ languages with 256k context.","summaryZh":"Qwen3.5-Omni 在 215 项音视频任务上达到 SOTA，提出 ARIA 实现稳定语音合成，支持 10+语言和 256k 上下文。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2509.17765","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸 · Alibaba Qwen","title":"Qwen3-Omni Technical Report","titleZh":"Qwen3-Omni 技术报告","published":"2025-09-22T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1758499200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2509.17765/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/35fbfa48d0af7ac0.webp","summary":"Qwen3-Omni is the first single multimodal model achieving state-of-the-art performance across text, image, audio, and video without degradation, with open-source SOTA on 32 of 36 audio benchmarks.","summaryZh":"Qwen3-Omni 是首个在文本、图像、音频和视频上均达到顶尖性能且无退化的单一多模态模型，在 36 个音频基准中 32 个达到开源最优。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2508.02324","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸","title":"Qwen-Image Technical Report","titleZh":"Qwen-Image 技术报告","published":"2025-08-04T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1754265600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2508.02324/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/b565ac2bbe517422.webp","summary":"Qwen-Image achieves significant advances in complex text rendering and precise image editing through a comprehensive data pipeline and progressive training strategy.","summaryZh":"Qwen-Image 通过全面的数据流水线和渐进式训练策略，在复杂文本渲染和精确图像编辑方面取得了显著进展。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2507.18071","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸 · Alibaba Qwen","title":"Group Sequence Policy Optimization","titleZh":"组序列策略优化","published":"2025-07-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1753315200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2507.18071/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/a37ebe18622e821e.webp","summary":"GSPO defines importance ratio based on sequence likelihood and performs sequence-level clipping, rewarding, and optimization, achieving superior efficiency and stability in LLM RL training.","summaryZh":"GSPO 基于序列似然定义重要性比率，并执行序列级别的裁剪、奖励和优化，在大语言模型强化学习训练中实现了卓越的效率和稳定性。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2505.06708","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸 · Qwen Team, Alibaba","title":"Gated Attention for Large Language Models: Non-linearity, Sparsity, and Attention-Sink-Free","titleZh":"大型语言模型的门控注意力：非线性、稀疏性与无注意力汇聚","published":"2025-05-10T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1746835200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2505.06708/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/94d6906115f82e9a.webp","summary":"A simple head-specific sigmoid gate after scaled dot-product attention improves LLM performance, stability, and long-context extrapolation by introducing non-linearity and sparse gating that mitigates attention sink.","summaryZh":"在缩放点积注意力后添加一个头部特定的 sigmoid 门控，通过引入非线性和稀疏门控来缓解注意力汇聚问题，从而提升大型语言模型的性能、稳定性和长上下文外推能力。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2503.20215","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸","title":"Qwen2.5-Omni Technical Report","titleZh":"Qwen2.5-Omni 技术报告","published":"2025-03-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1742947200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2503.20215/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/d84471dd5dbfc6b2.webp","summary":"Qwen2.5-Omni is an end-to-end multimodal model that streams text and speech from diverse inputs, achieving state-of-the-art performance on Omni-Bench and comparable text and speech instruction following.","summaryZh":"Qwen2.5-Omni 是一个端到端多模态模型，能够从多种输入中流式生成文本和语音，在 Omni-Bench 上达到最先进性能，且文本与语音指令遵循能力相当。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2502.13923","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸","title":"Qwen2.5-VL Technical Report","titleZh":"Qwen2.5-VL 技术报告","published":"2025-02-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1739923200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2502.13923/","image":"","summary":"Qwen2.5-VL achieves state-of-the-art performance in visual understanding, localization, and document parsing, with dynamic resolution and temporal encoding enabling hour-long video processing.","summaryZh":"Qwen2.5-VL 在视觉理解、定位和文档解析方面达到业界领先水平，通过动态分辨率和时间编码支持长达数小时的视频处理。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2407.10759","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸 · Alibaba Group (Qwen Team)","title":"Qwen2-Audio Technical Report","titleZh":"Qwen2-Audio 技术报告","published":"2024-07-15T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1721001600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2407.10759/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/f1905d6984b66e12.webp","summary":"Qwen2-Audio, a large-scale audio-language model, simplifies pre-training with natural language prompts, supports voice chat and audio analysis modes, and achieves SOTA on AIR-Bench.","summaryZh":"Qwen2-Audio 是一个大规模音频语言模型，通过自然语言提示简化预训练，支持语音聊天和音频分析两种模式，在 AIR-Bench 上达到最优性能。"},{"id":"junyanglin-2407.10671","sourceId":"junyanglin","sourceName":"林俊旸 · Alibaba (Qwen Team)","title":"Qwen2 Technical Report","titleZh":"Qwen2 技术报告","published":"2024-07-15T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1721001600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/junyanglin-2407.10671/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/968459cfea1b5cce.webp","summary":"Qwen2 series, with models from 0.5B to 72B parameters, surpasses most open-weight models and competes with proprietary ones across language, coding, math, and reasoning benchmarks.","summaryZh":"Qwen2 系列模型参数规模从 0.5B 到 72B，在语言理解、生成、多语言、编程、数学和推理等基准测试中超越大多数开源模型，并与闭源模型竞争。"}]}